<title>UK: GECC sets 500 mln mark bond due December 2001.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 500 mln mark bond due December 2001.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Goldman Sachs and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CO CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.075   PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    99.55     SPREAD	+26 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.525</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 121</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
